config MT7603E
	tristate "MediaTek MT7603E (PCIe) and MT76x8 WLAN support"
	select MT76_CORE
	depends on MAC80211
	depends on PCI
	help
	  This adds support for MT7603E wireless PCIe devices and the WLAN core
	  on MT7628/MT7688 SoC devices. This family supports IEEE 802.11n 2x2
